Unreleased

0.1.0-alpha.1
  - Initial alpha release of modernized pyfoscam library and CLI
  - Native asyncio-first core using direct aiohttp CGI communication
  - Encapsulated FTP engine with asyncio.to_thread offloading
  - Persistent local disk caching for historical recordings
  - Fast lossless AVI-to-MP4 remuxing and duration probing with asyncio subprocesses
  - Local media storage retention pruning
  - CLI commands: config, info, status, snapshot, stream, ptz, preset, motion, media (list, download, sync, prune, clear-cache)
